---
import Person from '../assets/icons/solid/person.svg';
---

<div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
  <div class="card-body">
    <h2 class="card-title text-xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
      <Person class="h-7 w-7 shrink-0 fill-primary" />
      About
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
      Senior Software Engineer with 8+ years of experience in full-stack web
      development. Currently serving as Member of Technical Staff - 3 at
      Cohesity Inc in Pune, India. Specialized in designing scalable frontend
      architectures using Angular, Vue.js, and React, alongside developing
      robust backend solutions with Node.js, NestJS, and Java Spring Boot.
      Demonstrates strong expertise in cloud technologies (AWS, GCP),
      containerization (Docker, Kubernetes), and DevOps automation. Passionate
      about building efficient systems, optimizing workflows, and mentoring
      teams.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
